   "clip": "PickUp",
   "kind": "in_place",
   "does": "needs \"take\": something on the ground, either a thing actor of at most 1 m or a person whose prop it takes after that person's earlier drop_prop. It walks over to it, bends down and lifts it in its hand, then carries it on its next walk or run. It takes about 1.2 s plus the walk (about 1 m a second), and that person's next move waits for it, so start them next to it"
  },
